    "kind": "COMPLEXITY",
    "quote": "After all runs are exhausted, every later attempt implicitly returns `error`.",
    "consequence": "Retry loops fail to terminate; infinite loops or wrong attempt counts.",
    "guard": "Track outcome position; return implicit error when past last run; count these attempts."
   },
   {
    "kind": "PRECEDENCE",
    "quote": "packet is dropped immediately; that final 'full' causes no spin, yield, or credit deduction",
