    "kind": "REDEFINITION",
    "quote": "'error' fails the packet and resets the level to zero. Credits are unchanged.",
    "consequence": "Incorrect final credits if they are reset on error instead of persisting.",
    "guard": "On error: reset level only; never modify credits. Credits change only on 'ok' or 'full'."
   },
   {
    "kind": "RANGES",
    "quote": "retries have already been scheduled for this packet ... max_retries applies per packet",
    "consequence": "Global retry limit applied instead of per-packet; vastly more retries than intended.",
    "guard": "Track retry_count per packet; check retry_count < max_retries for each packet independently."
   }
  ],
  "input_shape": "Seven parameters: packet lengths (up to 200k), run-length encoded outcomes (up to 200k runs with counts 10^18), retry/level/spin limits, credit range.",
  "output_shape": "Dictionary with 'packets' (status, retries, spins, yields per packet) and 'telemetry' (counters plus final level/credits).",
